abstract: "Repository for NIST-EPA Legionella study Python tools. Includes scripts for aerosol particle size distribution analysis, emission-rate calculations, data cleaning, visualization, and statistical modeling of shower-generated aerosols under varying temperature, humidity, and exhaust-fan conditions."
